            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-29T07:24:49.297743Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T07:24:49.297743Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a18689-d5f4-77e5-831e-0db6374714a8\",\"project_id\":\"01a1868a-c79d-76f3-a53e-6efc3fc60bca\",\"id\":\"01a1868c-130f-7723-823f-730e814ab523\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":5,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"eval\",\"member_id\":\"01a18689-d60c-75d6-bc4c-3ea94a80d257\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a1868a-d7cc-77ce-bbe0-6a5ec9e17f50\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a1868a-dc37-77c4-bb52-d0bd78c97309\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-29T07:24:49.298904Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"commands\":true,\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a1868c-130f-7723-823f-730d237bbae3\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a1868c-130f-7723-823f-730d237bbae3\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id